These 2 values will be taken and calculated from rule entity. Currently it contains only {{approver_phone. }}[https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/33e78b90951017f9392bc4519468e2195cd87d41/src/business/core/business_user/main/strategies/checkers/TripControlPreApprovalChecker.ts#L27|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/33e78b90951017f9392bc4519468e2195cd87d41/src/business/core/business_user/main/strategies/checkers/TripControlPreApprovalChecker.ts#L27]. We need to extend it with 2 additional values with appropriate default values: {{MAX_INTERVAL_FOR_PENDING_IN_HOURS}}and {{MAX_INTERVAL_FOR_APPROVED_IN_HOURS}} with default values 24 and 2 correspondingly.

{noformat}export interface BusinessGroupRuleTripControlApprovalRule extends BusinessGroupRule {
    type: BusinessGroupRuleType.TRIP_CONTROL_APPROVAL;
    approver_phone?: string;
}{noformat}

2.  There new fields should be passed from Business Portal on rule policy creation. So we need to extend API for policy creation and extend UI controller. Every policy will have independent values with default numbers.

