Research was done as part of the design document for “Unblocking verifications affected by an incident”


# AWS provider
## Get Media files task
### This task is used before any face match/liveness check in order to get the necessary files
### If a call to get media fails, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}
### If a call to get media files doesn’t find any media files, task fails only with {{MEDIA_FILES_NOT_FOUND}} reason
## Face detection task
### If no face is detected, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}
### For other errors, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}
## Face matching task
### If data gathering fails, task fails with {{MEDIA_FILES_NOT_FOUND}}
### If no face is found, task fails with {{FACE_NOT_FOUND}}
### For other errors, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}
# Onfido Provider/tasks
## If image datagathering fails, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}
## If calls to Onfido fail, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}} or {{UPLOADED_FILE_TOO_LARGE}} (probably the latter is not present anymore)
## Many Onfido calls are not in try..catch blocks, so a failure would mean that the task would be retried again and again, until call succeeds
# PDF conversion tasks
## If the document cannot be found, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}
## If the conversion fails, task fails with {{FILE_CONVERSION_FAILED}} only
# Smile identity provider/tasks
## if the flow run wasn’t triggered with correct params, task fails with {{INVALID_FLOW_RUN_PARAMS}} or {{DOCUMENT_WRONG_TYPE}} or {{UNSUPPORTED_ID_COUNTRY}}
## If call to create smile identity import fails, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}
## If smile identity response returns error code, we translate it to one of internal ones: {{ID_AUTHORITY_UNAVAILABLE}}, {{INVALID_DOCUMENT_NUMBERS}}, {{LICENSE_ERROR}}, {{DOCUMENT_NUMBER_FORMAT_CHECK_FAIL}} or {{SYSTEM_ERROR}} if no match
# Veriff provider/tasks
## If calls to veriff return error (client timeout or server error), task is retried.
### else, task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}}
## If call to getMediaFiles fails (infra issue), task is retried
## If no media files found, task fails with {{MISSING_DOCUMENT_FRONT}} (for both front and back)
## If a task args are not found, task is retried again and again ❗
# Model Invoker provider
## Predict Document liveness task
### If MediaFiles are not found, task fails with {{DOCUMENT_MISSING}} (no document entry in table) or {{DOCUMENT_PHOTOS_MISSING}} (no media files associated with doc entry)
### If call to model invoker doc liveness model fails, task fails with {{DOCUMENT_LIVENESS_ERROR}}
## Get data for fields extraction task
### If selected doc type is not supported by OCR, task fails with {{DOCUMENT_TYPE_NOT_SUPPORTED_BY_OCR}}
### If MediaFiles are not found, task fails with {{DOCUMENT_MISSING}} (no document entry in table) or {{DOCUMENT_FRONT_MISSING/DOCUMENT_BACK_MISSING}} (no media files associated with doc entry)
## Extract driver documents task
### If media files are not present, task fails with {{MEDIA_FILES_NOT_FOUND}}
### If call to model invoker OCR model fails, task fails with {{OCR_ERROR}} or {{DOCUMENT_WRONG_TYPE}}
#### If no ocr_group returned by model, task fails with {{MISSING_DATA}}
## Predict Selfie lieveness task
### if media files are not found (no url), task fails with {{MEDIA_FILES_NOT_FOUND}}
### If call to get selfie liveness fails, task fails with {{SELFIE_LIVENESS_ERROR}}
# VeritasTaskManager
## Datagathering task
### If no media files found, task fails with {{MISSING_DATA}}
## Postprocessing task
### If postprocessing methods fail, the task fails with the reason code coming from the method result
## UserHasCompletedFlowrun/TriggerSubFlowrun task
### Task fails with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}} whenever an unexpected param happens to be present
# VeritasSagemaker (aka Human Review)
## If media files are not found, task fails with {{MEDIA_FILES_NOT_FOUND}}
## For VisualFeatures, if document country is not set, task fails with {{DOCUMENT_VERSIONS_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW_NOT_FOUND}}
## Depending on the HR response, task fails for image quality issues/fraud attempts (no SYSTEM_ERROR). These reason codes are documented [here|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/3931538579/Human+review+answer-failure+reason+map].
## Rest of tasks fail with {{SYSTEM_ERROR}} in case of unexpected issue

